WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.687 --> 00:00:10.949
upon a time, there was a beautiful pond in the forest.

2
00:00:11.589 --> 00:00:13.450
The frogs lived there happily.

3
00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.391
"What a pleasant life!

4
00:00:16.011 --> 00:00:19.632
We have everything we want here," they all agreed.

5
00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:23.274
"But we have no king," said one frog.

6
00:00:23.294 --> 00:00:27.736
"You know, all the other animals in this forest have a king."

7
00:00:30.052 --> 00:00:35.434
"Yes, all of the other animals are proud of their kings," said another frog.

8
00:00:35.454 --> 00:00:40.836
"They might tease us because we do not have one," the frogs said to each other.

9
00:00:40.856 --> 00:00:45.978
"Let's ask the Forest God for a king," suggested one frog.

10
00:00:47.919 --> 00:00:50.300
So the frogs went to the Forest God.

11
00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:54.562
"Forest God, will you grant us a favor?"

12
00:00:55.062 --> 00:00:55.642
they asked.

13
00:00:56.323 --> 00:00:56.923
"What is it?"

14
00:00:56.943 --> 00:00:59.344
"We want to have a king."

15
00:01:00.096 --> 00:01:01.677
"You are free and happy now.

16
00:01:02.378 --> 00:01:03.619
Why do you want a king?"

17
00:01:04.299 --> 00:01:05.440
asked the Forest God.

18
00:01:07.581 --> 00:01:08.702
The frogs explained.

19
00:01:08.722 --> 00:01:13.545
"All the other animals have a king, but we don't."

20
00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:16.828
"Yes, they might laugh at us."

21
00:01:16.848 --> 00:01:22.011
"Forest God, please give us a king," the frogs said.

22
00:01:22.031 --> 00:01:26.594
"You should be happy with what you have," said the Forest God.

23
00:01:26.614 --> 00:01:30.805
"But since you insist, I will grant you your wish."

24
00:01:32.946 --> 00:01:35.827
The happy frogs went home to wait for their king.

25
00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:38.928
Suddenly, a log fell from the sky.

26
00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:41.949
Splash! "Run!

27
00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:44.370
Something is attacking us!"

28
00:01:45.151 --> 00:01:48.292
cried the frogs, and they hid at the bottom of the pond.

29
00:01:48.952 --> 00:01:51.634
After a while, the pond was quiet again.

30
00:01:51.654 --> 00:01:57.056
"Oh, it must be our king," suggested one of the frogs.

31
00:01:59.664 --> 00:02:01.345
"Yes, our king is here.

32
00:02:01.665 --> 00:02:04.487
Let's go bow to him," they decided.

33
00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:08.269
But the frogs found that their king did not move at all.

34
00:02:08.289 --> 00:02:11.031
"It is only a log!"

35
00:02:11.671 --> 00:02:12.251
said one.

36
00:02:12.952 --> 00:02:15.633
So they sat on the log and made faces at it!

37
00:02:17.474 --> 00:02:19.535
The frogs were unhappy with their king.

38
00:02:19.555 --> 00:02:21.677
"What a foolish king!

39
00:02:21.697 --> 00:02:24.038
Our king is not a real king."

40
00:02:24.058 --> 00:02:27.440
"The other animals might make fun of our king."

41
00:02:28.368 --> 00:02:34.092
"Let's go back to the Forest God and request a real king," they said to each other.

42
00:02:34.733 --> 00:02:37.175
So the frogs went to the Forest God again.

43
00:02:37.195 --> 00:02:40.577
"Mighty God!

44
00:02:41.078 --> 00:02:44.640
Please give us a real king," they asked.

45
00:02:45.381 --> 00:02:48.823
The Forest God was surprised that they did not like their king.

46
00:02:48.843 --> 00:02:54.728
"Hmm. Okay, I will send another king," he announced.

47
00:02:55.548 --> 00:02:58.509
The happy frogs went home to wait for the new king.

48
00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:01.911
Soon, an eel appeared in the pond.

49
00:03:01.931 --> 00:03:06.753
"Hello! I am your new king," he said.

50
00:03:06.773 --> 00:03:09.334
"Let's get along well together."

51
00:03:09.354 --> 00:03:13.076
"Hooray!" The frogs were happy.

52
00:03:13.096 --> 00:03:16.517
"We will obey everything you say."

53
00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:20.299
But the gentle eel never told them to do anything.

54
00:03:20.979 --> 00:03:23.100
He just enjoyed swimming in the pond.

55
00:03:25.276 --> 00:03:27.118
So the frogs held another meeting.

56
00:03:27.138 --> 00:03:29.339
"This king is no good.

57
00:03:29.879 --> 00:03:32.501
The eel is too good-natured to be a king."

58
00:03:32.521 --> 00:03:34.103
"You are right.

59
00:03:34.423 --> 00:03:36.744
The other animals laugh at him too."

60
00:03:36.764 --> 00:03:41.288
"Let's go back to the Forest God and demand a better king!"

61
00:03:41.868 --> 00:03:42.449
they said.

62
00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:46.592
The frogs went to the Forest God again.

63
00:03:46.612 --> 00:03:52.416
"Mighty God, please send us a better king," they demanded.

64
00:03:53.116 --> 00:04:00.218
"Yes, send us the strongest king, or we will keep coming back to ask for another."

65
00:04:02.219 --> 00:04:03.939
The Forest God was angry.

66
00:04:03.959 --> 00:04:08.441
"I have sent you two good kings that let you live freely.

67
00:04:09.041 --> 00:04:10.721
But you were not satisfied!

68
00:04:11.382 --> 00:04:15.183
Very well, I will send you a big, strong king!"

69
00:04:16.063 --> 00:04:19.244
The frogs went happily home to wait for their strong king.

70
00:04:21.248 --> 00:04:26.072
"Now the other animals will not laugh at our king," they said.

71
00:04:26.913 --> 00:04:29.635
Soon, the Forest God sent a heron to the pond.

72
00:04:30.356 --> 00:04:33.318
When the frogs saw the heron, they were happy.

73
00:04:33.338 --> 00:04:36.040
"Oh, look at our new king!"

74
00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:39.303
"He looks so tall and wonderful!"

75
00:04:40.864 --> 00:04:43.366
But the heron picked up a frog and ate it.

76
00:04:43.386 --> 00:04:45.308
"Oh my!

77
00:04:45.728 --> 00:04:47.149
Run! Run!"

78
00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:48.670
the others cried.

79
00:04:49.251 --> 00:04:50.292
But it was too late.

80
00:04:50.912 --> 00:04:55.757
The heron devoured frog after frog until there were none left in the pond.

81
00:04:56.498 --> 00:05:03.225
The Forest God watched the heron fly away and thought, "Sometimes it is best to be satisfied with

82
00:05:03.305 --> 00:05:04.086
what you have."
